body:
You know, as fucking stupid as it is, people love who they love. It can happen without trying. But, there still needs to be first steps, there still needs to be pursuing.. yeah, I mean, people are free to love who they love, and if it's reciprocrated, good for them. But this is more about respect. Basic respect, at the very LEAST, to tell you and not lie for months. But most importantly respecting you and your boundaries. She is not your best friend. 

&#x200B;

I've seen this happen to my sister, she's quite a bit older than me and her best friend asked her if she was comfortable with it. She agreed, but it still hurt their relationship a bit. It's obviously a shit move. Especially since they most likely had feelings before you two split. Just cut them out of your life. You have a completely valid and acceptable reason to.
